{"id":"8181bcdfbad8d73a","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-valuation.md","title":"Valuation","display":"df-valuation — Valuation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-valuation","aliases":["93-df-valuation"],"display":"df-valuation — Valuation","depends_on":["[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-term]]","[[93-df-variable]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-homomorphism]]","[[93-df-language]]","[[93-df-logic-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-valuation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-valuation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-valuation — Valuation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"00b872b34c5e977d\" href=\"?note=00b872b34c5e977d\" title=\"93-df-logic-algebra\">93-df-logic-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> is a language candidate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is its sourced type projection, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{App}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{App}_{93}\\)</span> is the tagged term constructor.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> have the signatures fixed in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\)</span> are from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"00b872b34c5e977d\" href=\"?note=00b872b34c5e977d\" title=\"93-df-logic-algebra\">93-df-logic-algebra</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FmCar}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FmCar}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FmOp}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FmOp}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FmOpFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FmOpFam}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> are the explicit formula-algebra constructors defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Val}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FmCar}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\nT_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FmCar}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\nT_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FmOp}_{93}(c;\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\bar\\varphi,\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}(c,\\bar\\varphi)\\right\\rangle:\n\\bar\\varphi\\in\n\\operatorname{FmCar}_{93}(\\mathcal L)^{\\pi_2(\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L))(c)}\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FmOp}_{93}(c;\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\bar\\varphi,\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}(c,\\bar\\varphi)\\right\\rangle:\n\\bar\\varphi\\in\n\\operatorname{FmCar}_{93}(\\mathcal L)^{\\pi_2(\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L))(c)}\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FmOpFam}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle c,\\operatorname{FmOp}_{93}(c;\\mathcal L)\\right\\rangle:\nc\\in\\pi_1(\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L))\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FmOpFam}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle c,\\operatorname{FmOp}_{93}(c;\\mathcal L)\\right\\rangle:\nc\\in\\pi_1(\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L))\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{FmCar}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\n\\operatorname{FmOpFam}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\right\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{FmCar}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\n\\operatorname{FmOpFam}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\right\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to\\Bigl(\n\\forall c\\in\\pi_1(\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L))\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FmOp}_{93}(c;\\mathcal L):\n\\operatorname{FmCar}_{93}(\\mathcal L)^{\\pi_2(\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L))(c)}\n\\to\\operatorname{FmCar}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathcal L)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to\\Bigl(\n\\forall c\\in\\pi_1(\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L))\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FmOp}_{93}(c;\\mathcal L):\n\\operatorname{FmCar}_{93}(\\mathcal L)^{\\pi_2(\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L))(c)}\n\\to\\operatorname{FmCar}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathcal L)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\\mathrm{Val}_{93}(v,\\mathcal L,\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(v,\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathbf A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\\mathrm{Val}_{93}(v,\\mathcal L,\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(v,\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathbf A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The source formula algebra is constructed from the exact type projected from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>; its carrier, each connective operation graph, and the complete operation-family graph are explicit, so no self-referential component notation is needed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"11b62d0ad578fa42","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-4","targe